item STAMP_HAMMER TOOLS HAND EQUIP,INSPECT Stamp Hammer
detail STAMP_HAMMER Stamps a delivery done. Also a hammer.
item FENCE_POST TOOLS - PLACE,DROP,SPLIT Fence Post
detail FENCE_POST From the Fence Smith. Marks your plot's edge.
item GATE_LATCH TOOLS - PLACE,DROP Gate Latch
detail GATE_LATCH A gate for your fence. Locks to your deed.
item SEED_WHEAT SEEDS - PLACE,DROP,SPLIT Wheat Seed
detail SEED_WHEAT Grows in a week of sun. The Scarecrow Elder hums to it.
item SEED_SUNFLOWER SEEDS - PLACE,DROP,SPLIT Sunflower Seed
detail SEED_SUNFLOWER Beekeeper Hollis pays honey for a field of these.
item SEED_RAIN_LILY SEEDS - PLACE,DROP Rain Lily Seed
detail SEED_RAIN_LILY Seed Broker Ott stocks it only when it rains.
item HONEY_JAR SEEDS - USE,DROP,SPLIT Honey Jar
detail HONEY_JAR Mends the parcel shield. Sticky.
item LETTER_GRUE MAIL - INSPECT Letter for Grue
detail LETTER_GRUE Postmaster Grue's. Stamp it at the board.
item LOST_LETTER MAIL - INSPECT Lost Letter
detail LOST_LETTER Addressed to someone in another realm. The ghost wants it delivered.
item PLOT_DEED DEEDS - INSPECT Plot Deed
detail PLOT_DEED Surveyor Ilka's claim on a parcel. Yours, on the chain (ADR-027).
item SATCHEL_ARMOR WEAR BACK EQUIP,INSPECT Satchel Armour
detail SATCHEL_ARMOR Pockets front and back. The parcel rides on top.
item PARCEL_SHIELD WEAR BACK EQUIP,INSPECT Parcel Shield
detail PARCEL_SHIELD A parcel that is also a shield. Don't drop it.
item HELI_SKID WEAR HELI EQUIP,INSPECT Heli Skid
detail HELI_SKID Rosa's upgrade. Lands on a fence post.
